sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Client
  participant C as Collection
  participant F as Metadata filter
  participant I as Index
  U->>C: query(vec, where tenant)
  C->>F: allow_ids from metadata
  F-->>C: id subset
  C->>I: search(vec, allow_ids)
  I-->>C: hits + n_scanned
  C-->>U: QueryResult
